### Dataset Attribution & Third-Party Data Licensing Notice

The transactional data utilized in this project is sourced from the UCI Machine Learning Repository:
- Dataset: Online Retail (Dataset ID: 352)
- Donor: Dr. Daqing Chen, London South Bank University
- License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
- Citation: Chen, D., Sain, S. L., & Guo, K. (2012). Data mining for the online retail industry: A case study of RFM model-based customer segmentation using data mining. Journal of Database Marketing & Customer Strategy Management, 19(3), 197–208.
